utoRoute: true\n      profile: mpd\n      presets:\n        - mpd\n      name: MPD Default\n      approval: required\n    profiles:\n      mpd:\n        description: >-\n          The specialist roster surfaced as normal-named teammate templates —\n          captain-planned (roster only; the captain designs the DAG during the\n          staged plan).\n        protocol: >-\n          Read-only members (Architect, Researcher, Planner, Explorer, Plan\n          Reviewer, Vision Analyst) take requirements/review/analysis tasks only\n          and never edit files. Workers (Senior Engineer, Junior Engineer, Deep\n          Worker, Lead, Reviewer) take implementation/verification/integration.\n          The captain leads, designs the DAG, and integrates results. Workmate\n          reuse: before delegating a role task, consult mpd_workmate_list /\n          mpd_workmate_match(task); if a workmate note matches well, delegate to\n          that workmate (member name = workmate name, so its persona/memory are\n          injected), otherwise initialize a fresh workmate with\n          mpd_workmate_init — never force a weak note match.\n        taskPlanning: captain\n        members:\n          - name: Architect\n            reasoning_effort: max\n            role: architecture review / deep debugging / self-review\n            provider: deepseek-official\n            model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            fallback:\n              provider: deepseek-official\n              model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            executionPrompt: >-\n              Read-only architecture advisor. You advise, others execute — never\n              edit files. Favor simplicity and existing patterns; give one clear\n              recommendation with concise rationale and evidence.\n            toolDeny:\n              - write\n              - edit\n              - mpd_hashline_edit\n              - bash\n              - mcp__ast_grep__rewrite\n              - mcp__ast_grep__scan\n              - mcp__lsp__rename\n          - name: Researcher\n            role: code / open-source evidence search\n            provider: deepseek-official\n            model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            fallback:\n              provider: deepseek-official\n              model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            executionPrompt: >-\n              Read-only researcher. Gather evidence from the codebase, AST/LSP\n              and web sources; cite file:line and URLs; never edit files or\n              invent findings.\n            toolDeny:\n              - write\n              - edit\n              - mpd_hashline_edit\n              - bash\n              - mcp__ast_grep__rewrite\n              - mcp__ast_grep__scan\n              - mcp__lsp__rename\n          - name: Planner\n            reasoning_effort: max\n            role: planning / task decomposition\n            provider: deepseek-official\n            model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            fallback:\n              provider: deepseek-official\n              model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            executionPrompt: >-\n              Read-only planner. Produce decision-complete, step-ordered plans\n              with a checklist; never implement.\n            toolDeny:\n              - write\n              - edit\n              - mpd_hashline_edit\n              - bash\n              - mcp__ast_grep__rewrite\n              - mcp__ast_grep__scan\n              - mcp__lsp__rename\n          - name: Explorer\n            role: read-only codebase exploration\n            provider: deepseek-official\n            model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            fallback:\n              provider: deepseek-official\n              model: deepseek-v4-flash\n            executionPrompt: >-\n              Read-only exp